From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Muse <muse@local>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 10:00:00 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] OTA manifest verification (Ed25519, kid fm1)

Add --verify-manifest <manifest.json> mode: verifies the Ed25519 signature
of the signed ota/manifest.json using the embedded release public key
(kid "fm1"), prints OK/FAIL, exits 0/1. Used by ota-update.sh to authenticate
updates before downloading anything.

Ed25519 code is extracted from TweetNaCl (public domain), trimmed to the
verify path only (SHA-512 + crypto_sign_ed25519_open), and embedded directly
in fileop.c because the Makefile lists SRCS explicitly (no new .c files).

Manifest format (signed by tools/make_manifest.py):
  {"files":[{"path":"FileManagement.zip","sha256":"<64hex>","size":N,
             "url":"https://.../FileManagement.zip"}],
   "kid":"fm1","version":"1.3.0","signature":"<b64url>"}
Signature covers the canonical body (keys sorted, compact, no whitespace).

---
