+// OTA manifest verification (Ed25519) — silent auto-update support.
+//
+// Verifies the signed ota/manifest.json before the update script trusts any
+// of its contents. The device has no openssl/python CLI, so the Ed25519
+// signature check is done here inside the binary (--verify-manifest).
