+// The Ed25519 code below is extracted from TweetNaCl (public domain,
+// http://nacl.cr.yp.to — D. J. Bernstein et al.), trimmed to the verify
+// path only (SHA-512 + crypto_sign_ed25519_open), and embedded directly
+// in fileop.c because the Makefile lists SRCS explicitly.
